 - `Schedule.cancel(appointment_id)` marks an appointment as cancelled. It stays on record and no longer blocks its slot.
+- `Schedule.free_slots(therapist, day, minutes)` returns the start times on a 15-minute grid from opening time at which an appointment of that length could be booked.
 
